  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses rank four golden and silver cup Gu with rank four another perspective Gu and rank four moving form Gu to refine rank five moving perspective cup Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          425
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_silver_cup_gu",
          "gu_another_perspective_gu",
          "gu_moving_form_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Moving perspective cup Gu is rank five, but in northern plains it is suppressed to rank four, with weaker capacity than other rank four Gu, high feeding cost, and heavy primeval essence use. Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable discovered its recipe hoping to send a cup into the space cave and bring out wild Gu; he failed that goal, yet four hundred years later his excavated blessed land spread the recipe and the Gu became famous across the regions.",
        "chapters": [
          434
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pair-swap-through-the-space-cave",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
          "sys_wild_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A complete set is two cups, one gold top and silver bottom, the other silver top and golden bottom. When activated, the pair enters the space cave, swaps places, and can transport resources between two sites; distance between the cups does not matter, while more cargo costs more primeval essence. Fang Yuan leaves one cup in Hu Immortal Blessed Land and carries the other, then uses the swap to move Gu and letters while he travels.",
        "chapters": [
          434
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "pair-swap-through-the-space-cave",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Moving perspective cup Gu uses the Space Door to transport objects and bypasses the five regions’ regional walls; it is a superb mortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1032
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cross-region-transport",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_space_door",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
